---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title={'Teaming'} description={'Teaming with Phoenix I/O: a senior small business under eight NAICS codes, with work packages we own end to end.'} page="teaming">
<section class="page" id="p-teaming" data-title="Teaming">
  <div class="pagehead"><div class="wrap"><span class="label">Teaming</span><h1>A senior partner for your next bid.</h1><p class="lede">For prime contractors' small-business liaisons and capture teams: a small business that can own a technical work package and help meet your subcontracting goals.</p></div></div>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="principles p3">
        <div class="pr"><span class="label">Small-business credit</span><h3>Counts toward your plan.</h3><p>Small under eight NAICS codes. Large primes above $900,000 need a subcontracting plan.</p></div>
        <div class="pr"><span class="label">Senior-only</span><h3>The proposal team is the delivery team.</h3><p>Every principal has 20+ years of delivery.</p></div>
        <div class="pr"><span class="label">Niche depth</span><h3>Hard problems, covered.</h3><p>Snowflake and dbt platforms, sub-millisecond systems, regulated health data.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="head"><div class="stack"><span class="label">Work packages</span><h2>What we own end to end.</h2></div></div>
      <div class="cols c3">
        <div class="col"><h3>Data platform migration</h3><p>Legacy warehouse to Snowflake on AWS or Azure, with dbt models and governance.</p></div>
        <div class="col"><h3>Reporting consolidation</h3><p>Hundreds of reports rationalized into a governed BI layer.</p></div>
        <div class="col"><h3>Secure application build</h3><p>Web and offline-first mobile apps with HIPAA-grade controls.</p></div>
        <div class="col"><h3>Observability</h3><p>OpenTelemetry instrumentation, dashboards as code, incident playbooks.</p></div>
        <div class="col"><h3>AI automation</h3><p>LLM workflows and agents with human review built in.</p></div>
        <div class="col"><h3>Proposal support</h3><p>Technical volumes and solution architecture for your bid.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="head"><div class="stack"><span class="label">How teaming works</span><h2>From first call to delivery.</h2></div></div>
      <ol class="steps">
        <li><h3>Intro call</h3><p>Share the opportunity and the gap you need filled.</p></li>
        <li><h3>Fit check</h3><p>We confirm NAICS, scope and staffing.</p></li>
        <li><h3>Proposal</h3><p>We write our technical sections and pricing.</p></li>
        <li><h3>Delivery</h3><p>A clear statement of work and a regular reporting cadence.</p></li>
      </ol>
      <div class="btns" style="margin-top:56px"><a class="btn primary" href="/contact/">Start a teaming conversation <span class="arr">→</span></a><a class="btn ghost" href="/contracting/">Company data</a></div>
    </div>
  </section>
</section>
</Base>
